// 1. retain forward → g_r = grad(CE(retain), $\theta$)
// 2. forget forward → g_f = grad(CE(forget), $\theta$)
// 3. entropy_max → g_h = grad(-H(p_forget), $\theta$)
// 4. importance score per param: $i_p = \|g_r^p\| / \max_p\|g_r^p\|$
// 5. mask_p = $1 - \sigma(10 \cdot i_p)$        // small for high-importance params
// 6. EMA(retain_loss) ← 0.1*loss + 0.9*EMA;
//    if EMA > 2 → $\alpha$ = 0.5*0.3; elif EMA > 1 → $\alpha$ = 0.8*0.3; else $\alpha$ = 0.3
// 7. param.grad ← g_r - $\alpha$ * (mask $\odot$ g_f) + 0.1 * g_h
// 8. clip grad-norm to 5.0; optimizer.step()

// 1. retain: $\mathcal{L}_r = \mathrm{CE}(z_\theta, y) + \lambda_{KD} \cdot T^2 \mathrm{KL}(p_\theta/T \| p_{\bar\theta}/T)$
// 2. forget target: mix = $\alpha \cdot \mathrm{teacher\_softmax}_{\setminus c_f} + (1-\alpha) \cdot \mathrm{Uniform}_{\setminus c_f}$
// 3. forget loss: $\mathcal{L}_f = T^2 \mathrm{KL}(\mathrm{softmax}(z_\theta \text{ with } z_{c_f}{=}{-}\infty)/T \| \text{mix}) + \overline{p_\theta(c_f|x^f)}$
// 4. compute g_r, g_f via autograd
// 5. update Fisher-EMA: $I \leftarrow 0.9 I + 0.1 g_r^2$;  damp_p = $1/(1 + 40\sqrt{I_p})$
// 6. g_f $\leftarrow$ damp $\odot$ g_f       // protect retain-important weights
// 7. if $\langle g_r, g_f \rangle < 0$:  g_f $\leftarrow$ g_f - $\frac{\langle g_r, g_f\rangle}{\|g_r\|^2} g_r$  // PCGrad-style projection
// 8. ramp = min(1, (epoch+1)/4); scale = $\lambda_f \cdot$ ramp $\cdot$ min(1, $\|g_r\|/\|g_f\|$)
// 9. param.grad $\leftarrow$ g_r + scale $\cdot$ g_f;  optimizer.step()
